# 基础词 Unit13
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2025红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 基础词Unit13核心词汇

{{naked}}{{/ˈneɪkɪd}}{{adj. 裸体的；赤裸的}}{{The children ran naked on the beach.}}
{{narrative}}{{/ˈnærətɪv}}{{n./adj. 叙述；叙事的}}{{The novel has a compelling narrative.}}
{{narrow}}{{/ˈnærəʊ}}{{adj./v. 狭窄的；缩小}}{{The road is too narrow for two cars to pass.}}
{{nasty}}{{/ˈnɑːsti}}{{adj. 令人不快的；恶劣的}}{{The weather turned nasty in the afternoon.}}
{{nation}}{{/ˈneɪʃn}}{{n. 国家；民族}}{{China is a nation with a long history.}}
{{native}}{{/ˈneɪtɪv}}{{adj./n. 本地的；本地人}}{{She is a native speaker of English.}}
{{natural}}{{/ˈnætʃrəl}}{{adj. 自然的；天然的}}{{Natural resources should be used wisely.}}
{{naval}}{{/ˈneɪvl}}{{adj. 海军的}}{{The country has a powerful naval fleet.}}
{{navigate}}{{/ˈnævɪɡeɪt}}{{v. 导航；航行}}{{The captain navigated the ship through the storm.}}
{{neat}}{{/niːt}}{{adj. 整洁的；整齐的}}{{Her handwriting is always neat and clear.}}
{{necessary}}{{/ˈnesəsəri}}{{adj. 必要的；必需的}}{{Sleep is necessary for good health.}}
{{negative}}{{/ˈneɡətɪv}}{{adj./n. 否定的；消极的；底片}}{{Try not to have a negative attitude towards life.}}
{{neglect}}{{/nɪˈɡlekt}}{{v./n. 忽视；疏忽}}{{He neglected his health and became ill.}}
{{negotiate}}{{/nɪˈɡəʊʃieɪt}}{{v. 谈判；协商}}{{The two sides negotiated a peace agreement.}}
{{neighbor}}{{/ˈneɪbər}}{{n. 邻居}}{{Our neighbors are very friendly and helpful.}}
{{nerve}}{{/nɜːv}}{{n. 神经；勇气}}{{It takes nerve to speak in front of a large audience.}}
{{nervous}}{{/ˈnɜːvəs}}{{adj. 紧张的；不安的}}{{She felt nervous before the job interview.}}
{{network}}{{/ˈnetwɜːk}}{{n. 网络；网状系统}}{{The internet is a global computer network.}}
{{neutral}}{{/ˈnjuːtrəl}}{{adj. 中立的；中性的}}{{Switzerland remained neutral during the war.}}
{{nevertheless}}{{/ˌnevəðəˈles}}{{adv. 然而；不过}}{{The task was difficult; nevertheless, they completed it.}}
{{noble}}{{/ˈnəʊbl}}{{adj. 高尚的；贵族的}}{{He comes from a noble family.}}
{{nod}}{{/nɒd}}{{v./n. 点头；同意}}{{She nodded in agreement with the suggestion.}}
{{nominate}}{{/ˈnɒmɪneɪt}}{{v. 提名；任命}}{{She was nominated for the best actress award.}}
{{nonetheless}}{{/ˌnʌnðəˈles}}{{adv. 尽管如此；然而}}{{The evidence is weak; nonetheless, it cannot be ignored.}}
{{norm}}{{/nɔːm}}{{n. 标准；规范}}{{Working from home has become the new norm.}}
{{normal}}{{/ˈnɔːml}}{{adj. 正常的；标准的}}{{Everything returned to normal after the storm.}}
{{notable}}{{/ˈnəʊtəbl}}{{adj. 值得注意的；显著的}}{{There has been a notable improvement in air quality.}}
{{note}}{{/nəʊt}}{{n./v. 笔记；注意}}{{Please note the change in schedule.}}
{{notice}}{{/ˈnəʊtɪs}}{{v./n. 注意到；通知}}{{Did you notice anything unusual?}}
{{notion}}{{/ˈnəʊʃn}}{{n. 概念；想法；意图}}{{The notion of equality is central to democracy.}}
{{novel}}{{/ˈnɒvl}}{{n./adj. 小说；新颖的}}{{She wrote her first novel at the age of 20.}}
{{nuclear}}{{/ˈnjuːkliər}}{{adj. 核的；核能的}}{{Nuclear energy is a controversial topic.}}
{{numerous}}{{/ˈnjuːmərəs}}{{adj. 许多的；大量的}}{{Numerous studies have shown the benefits of exercise.}}
{{nurse}}{{/nɜːs}}{{n./v. 护士；护理}}{{The nurse took care of the patients.}}
{{nutrition}}{{/njuˈtrɪʃn}}{{n. 营养；营养学}}{{Good nutrition is essential for children's growth.}}
{{obey}}{{/əˈbeɪ}}{{v. 服从；遵守}}{{Citizens should obey the law.}}
{{object}}{{/ˈɒbdʒɪkt/{{n./v. 物体；目标；反对}}{{Many people objected to the new regulation.}}
{{objective}}{{/əbˈdʒektɪv}}{{n./adj. 目标；客观的}}{{The main objective of the project is to reduce costs.}}
{{obligation}}{{/ˌɒblɪˈɡeɪʃn}}{{n. 义务；责任}}{{Paying taxes is an obligation of every citizen.}}
{{observe}}{{/əbˈzɜːv}}{{v. 观察；遵守；评论}}{{Scientists observed the behavior of the animals.}}
{{obtain}}{{/əbˈteɪn}}{{v. 获得；得到}}{{She obtained a degree in computer science.}}
{{obvious}}{{/ˈɒbviəs}}{{adj. 明显的；显而易见的}}{{The answer is obvious to everyone.}}
{{occasion}}{{/əˈkeɪʒn}}{{n. 场合；时机}}{{This is a special occasion for the whole family.}}
{{occupy}}{{/ˈɒkjupaɪ}}{{v. 占据；使忙碌}}{{The meeting occupied the entire morning.}}
{{occur}}{{/əˈkɜːr}}{{v. 发生；出现}}{{The accident occurred at midnight.}}
{{offend}}{{/əˈfend}}{{v. 冒犯；违反}}{{I'm sorry if my words offended you.}}
{{offer}}{{/ˈɒfər}}{{v./n. 提供；出价}}{{The company offered him a high salary.}}
{{official}}{{/əˈfɪʃl}}{{adj./n. 官方的；官员}}{{The official language of the country is English.}}
{{operate}}{{/ˈɒpəreɪt}}{{v. 操作；经营；动手术}}{{The doctor operated on the patient successfully.}}
{{opponent}}{{/əˈpəʊnənt}}{{n. 对手；反对者}}{{He defeated his opponent in the final match.}}
{{opportunity}}{{/ˌɒpəˈtjuːnəti}}{{n. 机会；时机}}{{This is a great opportunity for young graduates.}}
{{oppose}}{{/əˈpəʊz}}{{v. 反对；对抗}}{{Many citizens opposed the construction of the factory.}}
{{opposite}}{{/ˈɒpəzɪt}}{{adj./n./prep. 相反的；对面的}}{{The bank is opposite the supermarket.}}
{{optimistic}}{{/ˌɒptɪˈmɪstɪk}}{{adj. 乐观的}}{{She is optimistic about the future of the company.}}
{{option}}{{/ˈɒpʃn}}{{n. 选项；选择权}}{{You have three options to choose from.}}
{{orbit}}{{/ˈɔːbɪt}}{{n./v. 轨道；绕轨道运行}}{{The satellite orbits the earth every 90 minutes.}}
{{ordinary}}{{/ˈɔːdnri}}{{adj. 普通的；平凡的}}{{It was just an ordinary day.}}
{{organ}}{{/ˈɔːɡən}}{{n. 器官；风琴}}{{The heart is a vital organ in the human body.}}
{{organize}}{{/ˈɔːɡənaɪz}}{{v. 组织；安排}}{{She organized a charity event for the community.}}
{{origin}}{{/ˈɒrɪdʒɪn}}{{n. 起源；出身}}{{The origin of the tradition dates back centuries.}}
{{otherwise}}{{/ˈʌðəwaɪz}}{{adv./adj. 否则；另外}}{{Hurry up; otherwise, we'll be late.}}
{{outcome}}{{/ˈaʊtkʌm}}{{n. 结果；后果}}{{The outcome of the election surprised everyone.}}
{{outlet}}{{/ˈaʊtlet}}{{n. 出口；销路；插座}}{{The mall has many retail outlets.}}
{{outline}}{{/ˈaʊtlaɪn}}{{n./v. 轮廓；概述}}{{She outlined the main points of the plan.}}
{{output}}{{/ˈaʊtpʊt}}{{n. 产量；输出}}{{The factory's output has doubled this year.}}
{{outstanding}}{{/aʊtˈstændɪŋ}}{{adj. 杰出的；未解决的}}{{She is an outstanding scientist in her field.}}
{{overcome}}{{/ˌəʊvəˈkʌm}}{{v. 克服；战胜}}{{She overcame many difficulties to achieve her goal.}}
{{overlook}}{{/ˌəʊvəˈlʊk}}{{v. 忽视；俯瞰}}{{Don't overlook the small details.}}
{{overseas}}{{/ˌəʊvəˈsiːz}}{{adv./adj. 海外的；在海外}}{{Many students choose to study overseas.}}
{{overtake}}{{/ˌəʊvəˈteɪk}}{{v. 超过；赶上}}{{China has overtaken Japan in GDP.}}
{{owe}}{{/əʊ}}{{v. 欠；归功于}}{{I owe my success to my parents' support.}}
